feat(spawner): add OpenAI, cli:claude-code, cli:codex backends

Adds three new spawner backends:

- `openai` (first-class): mirrors the cloudflare adapter shape. Reads
  OPENAI_API_KEY from secret-env. Supports gpt-5 / gpt-5-mini /
  gpt-5-nano / gpt-4.1{,-mini,-nano} / gpt-4o{,-mini} / o4-mini / o3 /
  o1. Reasoning models get max_completion_tokens; chat models get
  max_tokens. OPENAI_BASE_URL is configurable for proxies / Azure.
  Default model: gpt-5-mini. Default timeout: 5 min. Default per-spawn
  budget cap: $0.10.

- `cli:claude-code` and `cli:codex`: drive the operator's local
  claude-code / codex CLI as a child process. Optional tube
  transparency: if a tubeClient is provided, the wrapper publishes the
  result on `cli:<tool>:<short-uuid>` for any observer. Auth caveats
  documented; auth failures from stderr surface actionable next-step
  copy (run `claude setup-token` / `codex auth login`). Economic
  motivation: a Claude Max ($200/mo) or ChatGPT Pro subscriber gets
  zero marginal cost per spawn at the wallet layer.

- `PD_USE_CLI_BACKEND=claude-code|codex` env override forces every
  spawn through the matching cli:<tool> backend regardless of
  pd-fleet.yml config. The "I have Claude Max, use that for
  everything" knob.

Cost rates added for all OpenAI models (lib/cost-tracker.ts).
Telemetry policy + backend readiness wired for the three new
backends. CLI-tube backends are marked flat-rate (subscription) and
record a $0.001 session estimate so daily project budgets and
spawn-rate limits still throttle them.

Docs: docs/fleet/backend-costs.md — comprehensive per-token rate
table for Cloudflare, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and CLI-backed
flat-rate backends; per-spawn budget defaults; monthly cost worked
example at 1000 spawns/mo; recommended fleet allocation
($12/mo for 8000 spawns).

Tests:
- tests/unit/spawner-openai-backend.test.js (17 tests; mocked fetch)
- tests/unit/spawner-cli-tube-backend.test.js (18 tests; mocked
  child_process)
- tests/integration/spawner-openai-smoke.test.js (gated on
  OPENAI_API_KEY)
- tests/integration/spawner-cli-tube-smoke.test.js (gated on
  PD_RUN_CLI_TUBE_SMOKE=1 + claude/codex on PATH)

Full unit suite: 5840 pass / 1 skipped / 0 fail. Zero regressions.


